<title>USA: Lehman Brothers awarded Washington $96 mln GOs.</title>
<headline>Lehman Brothers awarded Washington $96 mln GOs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co's bid of 5.55 percent true interest cost on a $96 million State of Washington motor vehicle fuel tax general obligation bond issue, Series 1997D, was rejected and the offering was awarded to Lehman Brothers with a true interest cost of 5.56 percent.</p>
